      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAYMAR FOX (1) doesn't win out of turn. Finished in the money last time though when second (21.97) at this track. Good form should continue. HARA'S OCEAN (2) was in winning form two back (21.85) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Solid record here at this trip including three wins. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. SISTER HOLLY (6) was a winner two back when prominent throughout then got further back last time and could manage only a 5.5 lengths 5th at this track (22.41). Comes through a solid form race last start. Has ability and can atone. FLY LIKE POTTER (8) did a good job to finish third last time out over 380m at this track (22.10) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
